WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Welcome to MedMatch! I'm excited to show you
our powerful features for job seekers.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Start with your personalized dashboard showing
AI-matched jobs and your Trust Score.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.500
Our job search lets you find remote, hybrid,
or on-site positions with smart filters.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.500
Upload your resume and our AI automatically
extracts your skills and experience.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Track all your applications in one place
and see your progress.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.500
Prepare for interviews with our coaching tools,
practice questions, and expert tips.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:34.000
MedMatch is your complete career platform
for life sciences success!
